### Create two-level menu
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/menus?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}

{
  "content": {
    "code": "main-menu",
    "type": "MENU",
    "name": "Main menu",
    "title": "Main menu",
    "description": "Primary navigation",
    "slug": "main-menu",
    "noIndex": true
  },
  "handle": "main",
  "items": [{
    "label": "Shop",
    "targetKind": "URL",
    "targetValue": "/shop",
    "openNewTab": false,
    "visible": true,
    "loginRequired": false,
    "children": [{
      "label": "Account",
      "targetKind": "URL",
      "targetValue": "/account",
      "openNewTab": false,
      "visible": true,
      "loginRequired": true,
      "children": []
    }]
  }]
}

> {% client.global.set("MENU_ID", response.body.content.id); %}

### Read normalized menu
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/menus?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&handle=main
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}

### Excessive depth returns 422 and leaves the old tree intact
PUT {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/menus/{{MENU_ID}}?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}

{
  "content": {"code":"main-menu","type":"MENU","name":"Main","noIndex":true},
  "handle": "main",
  "items": [{
    "label":"One","targetKind":"URL","targetValue":"/one","openNewTab":false,"visible":true,
    "loginRequired":false,"children":[{
      "label":"Two","targetKind":"URL","targetValue":"/two","openNewTab":false,"visible":true,
      "loginRequired":false,"children":[{
        "label":"Three","targetKind":"URL","targetValue":"/three","openNewTab":false,"visible":true,
        "loginRequired":false,"children":[]
      }]
    }]
  }]
}

### Cross-store menu lookup is hidden
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/menus?store={{STORE_ID_2}}&lang={{LANG}}&handle=main
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}
